# The build context is this app's own directory. fact-graph, form-builder and taxpert arrive as
# separate named build contexts (see Dockerfile / docker-compose.yml's `additional_contexts`)
# rather than subdirectories of this one, so this only needs to keep this app's own heavy,
# regenerable trees out of the context.
**/node_modules
**/target
**/out
**/.git
**/.bsp
**/.bloop
**/.metals

# Generated mirrors: the image vendors these from their sources during the build, so a developer's
# local copy must not ride along and win.
**/website-static/vendor/taxpert/
**/website-static/vendor/uswds-3.13.0/
